---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="pt-14 pb-16 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-24 border-b border-monolith-line dark:border-monolith-darkLine">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-6xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">{site.role}</p>
    <h1 class="text-[2.5rem] sm:text-6xl font-medium [text-wrap:balance] leading-[1.06] tracking-tightest">
      I deliver enterprise systems<br class="hidden lg:block" /> and build my own software.
    </h1>
    <div class="max-w-2xl pt-2 space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>I manage e-commerce, CMS, CRM and service desk platforms across Asia-Pacific and the vendors behind them, keeping delivery and budgets on track. When a vendor cannot resolve an issue, I find the root cause and fix it myself where I can.</p>
      <p>I have also been designing, building and running my own software for years, including web apps, browser extensions and Windows tools that people have downloaded hundreds of thousands of times.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
